fa-inna l-insāna iḏhuwa nawʿun qad yuḥmalu ʿalā Suqrāṭwa-Falāṭūn …
fa-ammā l-ḥayyu fa-iḏhuwa ǧinsun qad yuḥmalu ʿalā l-insāni wa-l-farasi wa-
l-ṯawri 1061.11–12 / fol. 147b;

wa-ammā l-ṣabiru wa-tūbālu l-nuḥāsi … iḏā šuribā ashalā l-baṭna ishālan
kaṯīran wa-yukaṯṯifāni l-badana, wa-ammā l-labanu fa-innahū iḏā muyyiza …
wa-šuribat (sc. māʾiyyatuhū) ashalati l-baṭna 109a8–9;

fa-ǧamīʿu aǧnāsi l-ḥayawāni llaḏī fīhi l-ḏakaru wa-l-unṯā yatawalladu min
ǧimāʿi ḏakarin wa-unṯā 2.1–2; III 6, 757a9–10 = 117.4–5; III 7, 757a15–21 = 117.8–13;
etc.

entries.body_text:
awāʾilu, and uwalu
1.
transl. ἀρχή(beginning) and its derivatives and compounds;
2.
transl. πρῶτος ( first) and its derivatives and compounds;
3.
transl. πρότερος (prior) and its derivatives and compounds;
4–6. transl. other terms denoting priority;
7–9. sem. amplif.; transl. terms, or is used in expressions, denoting priority
through sem. amplif.;
10.
interpr.; added in interpretive translations.
al-awwalu … al-ṯānī / al-āḫaru, transl. correlative or disjunctive expressions
awwalan adv.
awwala mā
